      "writtenOn": "2021-02-04T20:41:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should the error path here maybe emit a warning or something? I could definitely see the user being confused when changing a name from `libfoo` to `foo` silently causes a change in build.\n\nIn an ideal world, we\u0027d take it one step further and do this in blueprint validation, but if that\u0027s hard, we should at least print a warning (or hard error?)",
      "revId": "45ad91c2c90a816431e8a6be08a5c3f7d1818ce9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
